# Keep the build context small and never ship local secrets or build output.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.expo
**/.turbo
**/generated
**/.git
# Local dev-tooling dirs — huge (worktrees, caches, transcripts) and never needed in the image.
**/.claude
**/.cursor
**/.playwright-mcp
**/.github
**/.vscode
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log
apps/mobile/ios
apps/mobile/android
apps/mobile/test-results
apps/mobile/.playwright-mcp
**/.DS_Store
